   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "maybe a month.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.28,
   "block": "cleaning.dlg14",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You're not alone, plenty of people stretch it. But sweat and skin build up, and that's what dust mites love.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.81,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, and another thing. My sister needs a first car and asked me to help her pick.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "block": "cars.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sorry, can you not jump in until I've covered all of them?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instruction_v2_04"
  },
